files:
**Create assets/js/settings.js.** It holds:
- state (cloned from SUFRA) with snapshots for Undo, drafts, and the viewer from ?as=;
- the sidebar me fields, set before app.js;
- the router;
- the nav summaries;
- the four area renderers;
- the shared editor, note and Undo engine;
- the logo checks and object URLs;
- the preview;
- the 'Where it appears' snippets;
- the beforeunload guard.

It reuses Beats.sig, Beats.write, Beats.esc, IQ.avatar, IQ.line, IQ.glyph, IQ.lead, JOBS.on (stepOf, route, ahead, reach) and order.js's date format.

**Create assets/css/settings.css.** Prefix se- (free: neither se- nor sg- is used; st- is taken by auth.css and line.css). It holds:
- the head, .se-body container and grid, nav (column, row, phone list), area head and back link;
- setting rows and text buttons;
- the editor block (n50, radius 16);
- notes;
- people, invitation and message rows;
- the preview (mail and chat);
- the plate, logo tile and snippets;
- .se-as;
- `.org-mark img { display: block; width: 32px; height: 32px }` for the sidebar's logo tile;
- `.field select` styled like `.field input` (48 px, radius 12, n400 border).

No new shadows.
